    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2164_8111.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freündtlich willig dinst zuvor, Fuersichtige
<lb n="2"/>Ersame und weise, besonders liebe gute
<lb n="3"/>freünd und nachbaurn.
<lb n="4"/>Wir haben E. Ft. schriben den <date resp="#ner">12ten diß</date> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>abgangen wol empfangen, und thun uns der
<lb n="6"/>guetwilligen communication freündtlich be-
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">danckhen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhoffend</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">es</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">interim</unclear> unser
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schriben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eiusdem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dati</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bej</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">botten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denselben</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>auch zue kommen sein, darinnen E. Ft. allen
<lb n="10"/>bericht, was uns dißmal bewüßt zubefinden:
<lb n="11"/>Seither haben wir nichts besonders erfahren, dann
<lb n="12"/>allein ist uns heüt von einem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertrawten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ort</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aviso</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kommen</unclear>, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inligender</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">extract</unclear> auß
<lb n="14"/>weißt: Jtem fielt zue, das
<lb n="15"/>albereit ob der <placeName resp="#ner">Ruggsteig</placeName>, in den quartieren
<lb n="16"/><placeName resp="#ner">Scheittegg</placeName> und <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-25" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Weiler</placeName> ordinantz geben worden,
<lb n="17"/>das sich daselbst die underthanen widerumben
<lb n="18"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">victualien</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> aber-
<lb n="19"/>mal von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-60" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Bregentz</placeName> auß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volckh</unclear> werde <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuege</unclear>-
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuehrt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>; Dahero wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhoffentlich</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> gästen bald wider abkommen werden.
<lb n="22"/>Alle discurs und andere vermuottungen gehen
<lb n="23"/>dahin, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volckh</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seije</unclear> theils, wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesperr</unclear>-
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Paß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pünten</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">theils</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> ent-
<lb n="25"/>standnen geschreijs, alls ziehe der Union volckh
<lb n="26"/>bej der <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-173" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Tonaw</placeName> das <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-151" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Ilerthal</placeName> herauff ins <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-266" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Algöw</placeName>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2164_8112.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="27"/>den rieden auffgehalten worden; dahero dann
<lb n="28"/>auch erfolgt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">man</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-7" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Costantz</unclear></placeName> und sellig
<lb n="29"/>enden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefloehnet</unclear>.
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sonsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ist</unclear> nit ohne, daß diß Neapolitanisch volckh
<lb n="31"/>sich trutzig gnuog erzeigt, und mangelt an
<lb n="32"/>ihrem willen nit, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muothwillen</unclear>, wann
<lb n="33"/>sies maechtig waren, zueueben, deß betroewens,
<lb n="34"/>seie man schier gewohnt, unsere burger, welche
<lb n="35"/>zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-60" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Bregentz</placeName> und der enden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuethun</unclear> haben,
<lb n="36"/>woellen von ihnen nicht gern geduldet werden,
<lb n="37"/>ohngeacht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wein</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andere</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">victualien</unclear>, gegen bezahlung, auß unser statt
<lb n="39"/>folgen lassen.
<lb n="40"/>Durch die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Puendt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> 100 teuetsche reueter so
<lb n="41"/>in <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-188" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Venedig</placeName> abgedanckht worden herab kommen,
<lb n="42"/>deren 50 von dem Grafen zue Embs angehalten
<lb n="43"/>worden, die uebrige sein gestern von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-88" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Rheinegg</placeName>
<lb n="44"/>auß, zue <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wasser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alher</unclear> kommen, haben fuoter
<lb n="45"/>und mahl genommen, und alßbald auff das
<lb n="46"/>land fort nacher dem vatterland.
<lb n="47"/>Weiters haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißmal</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be</unclear>-
<lb n="48"/>richten, im fall aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">enderung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerfalt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fst</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ferner</unclear>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">avisieren</unclear> nicht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underlassen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear>,
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwartung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihrer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ferneren</unclear> gegen avisi,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2164_8113.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="52"/>mit guter vertraulicher nachbarschafft wol
<lb n="53"/>beigethon verbleiben, uns damit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sambtlichen</unclear>
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gottes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnadenreichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreuelich</unclear>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelchend</unclear>, datum <origDate resp="#ner">13. Novembris a° siebenzig</origDate>.
<lb n="56"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ge=</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhats</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lindaw</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2164_8114.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="58"/>Den fürsichtigen ersamen und weisen, <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger-
<lb n="59"/>meistere und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehaimen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Raths</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünden</unclear> und
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="62"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName>.
</p>
        </body>
